### ─────────────────────────────────────────────
### HalalPay API - Test Endpoints
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────

@baseUrl = http://localhost:4400
@apiKey = sk_test_halalpay_demo_123


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════
### HEALTH CHECKS
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════

### 1. Service Info
GET {{baseUrl}}/


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════
### PRODUCTS
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════
@Id = 1e1ffa7f-ac5e-4462-ba48-d2ec9504d22f

### 2. Search Products
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/products/search?q=phone&category=&minPrice=&maxPrice=&sortBy=
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

### 3. Get Product by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/products/{{Id}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

### 4. List Product Categories
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/products/categories/list
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════
### CART
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════

### 5. Get Active Cart
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/cart
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

### 6. Add Item to Cart
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/cart/add
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

{
  "productId": "{{Id}}",
  "quantity": 1
}

### 7. Remove Item from Cart
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/cart/remove
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

{
  "productId": "{{Id}}"
}

### 8. Clear Cart
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/cart/clear
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════
### CHECKOUT
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════

### 9. Create Checkout Session (from cart)
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/checkout/sessions
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

{
  "currency": "USD",
  "description": "Test checkout"
}

### 10. Create Checkout Session (with explicit amount)
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/checkout/sessions
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

{
  "amount": 500,
  "currency": "USD",
  "description": "Direct amount checkout"
}

### 11. Get Checkout Session
@sessionId = 8861e150-130d-44d3-875a-e406feaf87bb
@txId = f98bb881-4fde-47b9-9874-1183a6893a72

GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/checkout/sessions/{{sessionId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

### 12. Complete Checkout Session. Notify and mark as paid
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/checkout/sessions/{{sessionId}}/complete
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

{
  "transactionId": "{{txId}}"
}